    "form_state": "Stepper keeps ONE flat Record<string, JsonValue> (stepsState) for all steps; handleChange/handleNext shallow-merge each step's formData into it. Every step's <Form> receives formData={stepsState} and formContext.formData=stepsState, so earlier answers ARE present in later steps' data, but each step's schema is only that step's own JSON Schema.",
    "cross_step_visibility_today": "No first-class feature. Same-step conditionals via JSON Schema dependencies / allOf if-then are documented and tested. Cross-step use is undocumented and untested; it may partly work by accident because rjsf resolves if/then/dependencies against the full formData. Values from hidden fields stay in stepsState and get submitted, because liveOmit/omitExtraData are stripped from formProps.",
    "existing_conditional_hooks": [
